  <h1>Appendix C: The Agent Onboarding Test</h1>

  <p>
    The agent onboarding test checks whether a capability's contract is
    enough, on its own, for an agent to navigate the capability safely.
    It evaluates the contract, not the agent.
  </p>
  <p>
    The appendix includes scoring bands and a legibility index. It is
    the book's artifact for that check. It is not a command in the
    companion cdad CLI, which the book does not cover.
  </p>

